<span class="equation-label"><a data-tag="0339" href="/tag/0339">4.24</a></span>
<div>\begin{equation}  \begin{gathered}\label{equation:categorical-pullback-square5} \xymatrix@R =50pt@C=50pt{ X_{01} \ar [r] \ar [d] &amp;  X_0 \ar [d]^{q} \\ X_1 \ar [r] &amp;  X } \end{gathered} \end{equation}</div>
</div>
<p> is a categorical pullback square if and only if it is a homotopy pullback square. </p>
